<title>FRANCE: Sodexho net income up in first half.</title>
<headline>Sodexho net income up in first half.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income less minority interests  269.39  vs	  213.31</p>
<p>    Operating income			  683.60  vs	  561.43</p>
<p>    Net sales				   14,148  vs	  12,398</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
